# Owning option data is independent of descriptions, views and popup lifetime.
import lib/sequence.dl

class:
    patterns:
        UI option
    members:
        id as a string
        label as a string
        enabled as a boolean
        icon as a C string

UI option values means: the type of (an empty sequence of UI option)

to get [a UI option named] {a value:id} [displaying] {a value:label} [enabled] {boolean:enabled}:
    set key to the string form of id
    require condition (key's length > 0) reporting "A UI option requires a nonempty identity"
    return @intrinsic("construct", UI option, key, the string form of label, enabled, "")
